# Uncle Mario - Restock Calls, Cooldowns, Incoming Tier Alerts & Bespoke Upgrade Deliveries
# Voice: Energetic, practical, affectionate tricycle-supplier Tito. Fast on utility calls; proud on upgrades!
# Rules: 100% spoken voice. Counter, not grille. Zero [pause] spam, zero em-dashes, zero time-of-day words.

label Call
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: O, anak! Sidecar's empty and ready. Running low on stock?
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Uncle Mario on the line! What are we loading onto the tricycle, anak?
else:
	UncleMario: Just finished strapping the crate rack, anak! Need a restock run?
- Send a restock order.
	[signal arg="mario_open_restock"]
	UncleMario: Sige, punch in your list and I'll kick-start the tricycle!
- Wrong dial, Uncle!
	[signal arg="mario_cancel_call"]
	UncleMario: Haha, pocket-dialed your own uncle? Ring back anytime, anak!
[end_timeline]

label Busy
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Oy, take care of the neighbor at your counter first, anak! Ring me right after.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Eyes on the counter, kid! Finish up with your customer, I'm not going anywhere.
else:
	UncleMario: Serve your suki first before calling your supplier, ha! Talk soon.
[end_timeline]

label CallRest
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Easy, anak, my tricycle engine's still ticking hot! Give me {Transaction_MarioRestTime} to cool it down.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Catching my breath over merienda first, anak. Ring me again in {Transaction_MarioRestTime}!
else:
	UncleMario: Still loading crates at the warehouse! Give your uncle {Transaction_MarioRestTime}, ha.
[end_timeline]

label Delivery
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Fresh haul unloaded, anak! Bags are right by the corner whenever your hands are free.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Restock's all stacked! Don't forget to drink water behind that counter, ha.
else:
	UncleMario: Everything on your list made it in one piece, anak! Holler if shelves run thin.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label TierUpgradeDelivery
UncleMario: Big haul, anak! Unloaded your new stock tier plus free starter samples in the bags!
UncleMario: Word's spreading fast down the road that Lola's shop carries the good stuff again.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label UpgradeCall
UncleMario: Uy, anak, glad you picked up! My supplier in town just opened a fresh wholesale tier for us.
UncleMario: Look what I can haul for your shelves now: {Global_UpgradeItemsList}
UncleMario: Want to check out the store upgrades while I'm at the warehouse?
- Check store upgrades!
	[signal arg="mario_open_upgrade"]
	UncleMario: Now we're talking! Take a look at what's ready.
- Just restocking for now.
	[signal arg="mario_open_restock"]
	UncleMario: Sige, regular restock first! Send me your list.
- Maybe later, Uncle.
	[signal arg="mario_cancel_call"]
	UncleMario: No rush, anak! Ring me whenever your register's ready to expand.
[end_timeline]

label MissedUpgradeCall
UncleMario: There you are, anak! Tried ringing you earlier, counter must've been packed!
UncleMario: Good news from the warehouse: new wholesale stock just opened up, including {Global_UpgradeItemsList}
UncleMario: Want to browse the upgrade list right now, or stick to a regular restock?
- Check store upgrades!
	[signal arg="mario_open_upgrade"]
	UncleMario: Let's see what catches your eye, anak!
- Just restocking for now.
	[signal arg="mario_open_restock"]
	UncleMario: Got you covered! Punch in your usual restock list.
- Maybe later, Uncle.
	[signal arg="mario_cancel_call"]
	UncleMario: Sige, take your time! I'll keep those crates reserved for you.
[end_timeline]

label StoreUpgradeDelivery
UncleMario: All bolted down and ready to roll, anak! Shop's looking sharper every run.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label StoreUpgradeAlso
UncleMario: Oh, and one more thing off the sidecar, anak!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Refrigerator Upgrades (Lv. 1-3) ---
label FridgeUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Fitted that new magnetic gasket onto Lola's fridge door, anak!
UncleMario: Snaps shut nice and tight now, so cold air won't slip out half as fast.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label FridgeUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Packed heavy-duty thermal lining inside the fridge walls, anak!
UncleMario: Your bottles and frozen packs will stay frosty way longer during busy rushes.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label FridgeUpgradeDelivery3
UncleMario: Swapped in the commercial inverter compressor, anak! Listen to how quiet that hum is!
UncleMario: Your Lola used to whack the side of this fridge with a slipper. Now it cools ice-cold in seconds!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Store Cat Upgrades (Lv. 1-2) ---
label CatUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Look who hopped straight into my sidecar at the market, anak! Meet Mingming!
UncleMario: Neighbors always linger where a fat orange cat naps, so two customers can line up at your counter now.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label CatUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Unloaded the big sack of cat food for Boss Mingming, anak!
UncleMario: Spoiled cat means a lively stoop, get ready for up to three neighbors crowding your counter at once!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Trash Can & Recycling (Lv. 1-2) ---
label TrashCanUpgradeDelivery
UncleMario: Set a heavy-duty bin right in the corner for you, anak.
UncleMario: Toss any extra or unwanted items straight in whenever your shelves need breathing room.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label RecyclingUpgradeDelivery
UncleMario: Brought you proper sorting bins, anak! Zero waste in this tindahan.
UncleMario: Anything you toss in there, I'll haul back to town and refund half its price to your drawer.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Maneki-Neko Upgrades (Lv. 1-2) ---
label ManekiUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Set the little waving porcelain cat right on your counter, anak!
UncleMario: Keeps folks in a generous mood, expect bigger cash tips clinking into your tray.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label ManekiUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Popped fresh heavy-duty batteries into your waving cat, anak! Look at that paw go!
UncleMario: Extra good fortune on every cash sale now. Don't forget your uncle when you're rich, ha!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Barangay Radio Upgrades (Lv. 1-3) ---
label RadioUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Hooked up a counter transistor radio tuned straight to Papa Ulap's station, anak!
UncleMario: Tap the dial whenever it's ready to catch market trends and hear who's strolling down the road.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label RadioUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Soldered a copper tuning coil into your radio, anak. Way less static now!
UncleMario: Papa Ulap's signal comes in strong enough to tip you off on more visitors and market swings.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label RadioUpgradeDelivery3
UncleMario: Mounted a high-gain antenna amplifier onto your radio, anak! Crystal-clear across all of Karimlan!
UncleMario: Not a single market rush or regular on the road will catch your shelves by surprise now.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Wholesale Pass Upgrades (Lv. 1-2) ---
label WholesaleUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Talked my warehouse boss into putting your shop on my family wholesale card, anak!
UncleMario: You get two discounted Sulit Deals every shift now, and I can turn my tricycle around much faster.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label WholesaleUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Signed you onto a full bulk contract at the depot, anak!
UncleMario: Five deep Sulit Deals on every restock sheet now. Even big groceries in town don't get rates that sweet!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Sto. Niño Altar Upgrades (Lv. 1-3) ---
label StoNinoUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Cleared a clean spot on your shelf for the Sto. Niño altar, anak.
UncleMario: Tap gently to ask for a blessing over your shift whenever the counter needs a little grace.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label StoNinoUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Polished the altar stand and set fresh candles beside Sto. Niño, anak.
UncleMario: Every prayer grants two blessings side by side now. Your Lola would love seeing this corner tended.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label StoNinoUpgradeDelivery3
UncleMario: Brought the heirloom brass vestment for your Sto. Niño altar, anak.
UncleMario: Once you tap for grace now, both blessings hold steady until you close up shop.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Business Permit Upgrades (Lv. 1-3) ---
label PermitUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Picked up your framed Barangay Business Permit from the hall, anak!
UncleMario: Your Lola kept hers tucked behind the soy sauce bottles. Hang yours proud for faster store growth!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label PermitUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Fresh from the municipal office, anak, official town accreditation for your tindahan!
UncleMario: Whole municipality knows your counter runs fair and square now.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label PermitUpgradeDelivery3
UncleMario: Hold onto your chair, anak. The council awarded your shop Karimlan Heritage Recognition!
UncleMario: From your Lola's hands straight to yours. Wish she were standing here to read that brass plate.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Tambayan Bench Upgrades (Lv. 1-3) ---
label BenchUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Unloaded a solid wooden tambayan bench right outside your storefront, anak!
UncleMario: Neighbors love resting their feet in the shade, and lingering folks mean livelier stories at your counter.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label BenchUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Sanded and varnished the tambayan bench with extra footrests, anak!
UncleMario: Folks are getting so comfortable out there you'll pick up plenty of experience just chatting between rushes.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label BenchUpgradeDelivery3
UncleMario: Upgraded the whole tambayan corner, anak! Nobody wants to go home early anymore.
UncleMario: Half the neighbors chatting on that bench will work up a fresh craving and step right back up to buy!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

# --- Storefront Customization Upgrades (Lv. 1-3) ---
label StorefrontUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Hoisted your blank roof signboard right above the eaves, anak!
UncleMario: Open your Store Upgrades menu anytime to paint it however you want. Make the whole road look twice!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label StorefrontUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Mounted the promo poster frame out front, anak!
UncleMario: Slap three matching item stickers on your poster whenever you want neighbors craving that category.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label StorefrontUpgradeDelivery3
UncleMario: Found this tarnished brass key tucked inside my old toolbox, anak. Fits your shop's side door.
UncleMario: Whenever you want to stretch your legs and see Karimlan from the street, that door unlocks for you now.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]
